 ""} "Wrestling in other Games"] "\n" [:option {:value "75"} "1870 Zappas Olympic Games"] "\n" [:option {:value "1"} "1896 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "3"} "1904 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "4"} "1906  Intercalated Games"] "\n" [:option {:value "5"} "1908 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "6"} "1912 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "7"} "1920 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "8"} "1924 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "9"} "1928 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "10"} "1932 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "11"} "1936 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "12"} "1948 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "13"} "1952 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "14"} "1956 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "15"} "1960 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "16"} "1964 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "17"} "1968 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "18"} "1972 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "19"} "1976 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "20"} "1980 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "21"} "1984 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "22"} "1988 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "23"} "1992 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "24"} "1996 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "25"} "2000 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "26"} "2004 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "65"} "2010 Summer Youth Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "54"} "2012 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "67"} "2014 Summer Youth Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "59"} "2016 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "69"} "2018 Summer Youth Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "61"} "2020 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:option {:value "63"} "2024 Summer Olympics"]]] [:script {} "$('#sport_in_other_games_select').change(function(){location.href='/editions/' + $('#sport_in_other_games_select').val() + '/sports/WRE'})"] "\n" [:h1 {} "Wrestling at the 2008 Summer Olympics"] "\n" [:table {:class "biodata"} "\n" [:tbody {} [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Dates"] "\n" [:td {} "12 – 21 August 2008"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Medal Events"] "\n" [:td {} "18"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Venues"] "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/venues/847"} "Zhongguo Nongye Daxue Tiyuguan, Beijing"]] "\n"] "\n"]] "\n" [:div {:class "description"} "\n" [:p {} "The 2008 wrestling events were held at the " [:a {:href "/venues/847"} "China Agricultural University Gymnasium"] ", an indoor arena on the campus of the China Agricultural Gymnasium in Beijing. The gymnasium was built specifically for the Beijing Olympics but was turned into a sports complex for the university after the Games."] "\n\n" [:p {} "The wrestling program was the same as in 2004, with 7 events in both freestyle and Greco-Roman for men, and 4 freestyle events for women. The formats were changed again in 2008, this time using basically a single-elimination tournament. A Bergvall style repêchage tournament was then held among all those losing to the finalists. Those wrestlers competed in single-elimination matches until only two remained, and both of them were given bronze medals, thus, there were two bronze medals in every class for the first time at the Olympics. The individual match format was also changed, with wrestlers competing more in a tennis-style format of three periods. To win a match a wrestler had to win two of three periods, and the match would end after the second period, if the score was 2-0."] "\n\n" [:p {} "As in 2004, Russia dominated the men’s events, leading with 10 medals and 6 golds, and leading both medal lists (totals and golds) in both styles. And as they had been in 2004, Japan was the leading women’s nation, winning medals in all 4 events with 2 gold, 1 silver, and 1 bronze medal, precisely as they had done at Athina."] "\n\n" [:p {} "In 2015 the IOC began re-testing samples from the 2008 Beijing and 2012 London Olympics, using newer, more advanced testing techniques, in an effort to find those who had used performance enhancing drugs (PEDs), but in whom it could not be detected at the time of those Olympics. The 2008 wrestling competition was affected, with 7 wrestlers, all medalists, caught for PED disqualifications. One gold medalist, " [:a {:href "/athletes/95185"} "Artur Taymazov"] ", lost his title in the 120 kg freestyle class."] "\n\n"] "\n\n" [:h2 {} "Events"] "\n" [:table {:class "table table-striped"} "\n" [:thead {} "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Event"] "\n" [:th {} "Status"] "\n" [:th {} "Date"] "\n" [:th {} "Participants"] "\n" [:th {} "NOCs"] "\n"] "\n"] "\n" [:tbody {} [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/263597"} "Featherweight, Greco-Roman (≤55 kg), Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "12 August 2008"] "\n" [:td {} "19"] "\n" [:td {} "19"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/263643"} "Lightweight, Greco-Roman (≤60 kg), Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "12 August 2008"] "\n" [:td {} "20"] "\n" [:td {} "20"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/263689"} "Welterweight, Greco-Roman (≤66 kg), Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "13 August 2008"] "\n" [:td {} "20"] "\n" [:td {} "20"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/263735"} "Middleweight, Greco-Roman (≤74 kg), Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "13 August 2008"] "\n" [:td {} "20"] "\n" [:td {} "20"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/263781"} "Light-Heavyweight, Greco-Roman (≤84 kg), Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "14 August 2008"] "\n" [:td {} "20"] "\n" [:td {} "20"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/263827"} "Heavyweight, Greco-Roman (≤96 kg), Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "14 August 2008"] "\n" [:td {} "20"] "\n" [:td {} "20"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/263873"} "Super-Heavyweight, Greco-Roman (≤120 kg), Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "14 August 2008"] "\n" [:td {} "20"] "\n" [:td {} "20"] "\n"] 